\tabular{lll}{
   \code{status} \tab Meaning \tab What to do \cr
   \code{"discrepancy"} \tab The numerical bounds on the difference lie wholly beyond \code{tolerance} on one side \tab Do not report the approximate probability. Sample the model \cr
   \code{"within_tolerance"} \tab Both bounds lie inside \code{tolerance} \tab You can report the approximate probability, for this threshold only \cr
